config INFINIBAND_AMD_EMRDMA
	tristate "AMD Emulated RDMA Driver (vfio-user)"
	depends on PCI && INET
	help
	  This driver provides support for AMD Emulated RDMA devices,
	  designed for use with vfio-user based userspace device emulation.
	  
	  This driver is based on VMware's PVRDMA but includes polling
	  logic to handle asynchronous BAR writes in vfio-user environments.
	  
	  The driver can optionally pair with VMXNET3 for VMware
	  compatibility, but also supports standalone operation without
	  requiring any specific network device.
	  
	  If unsure, say N.
